      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'Die deel aan 'n voël of vliegtuig se sy waarmee dit vlieg.': The possessive 'aan 'n voël of vliegtuig se sy' is awkward.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Hulle het gesien hoe 'n voël se vlerke buig en hoe hulle draai.': 'hulle' could mean the wings (grammatically nearest) or birds or the brothers; the intended referent (wings twisting, or the bird turning) cannot be fixed without guessing the content.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Die broers se glyvlugte was verby sodra daardie hoogte op was. Dan hoe': The glide-flight sentence sits between the two engine sentences, so 'Dan' follows a sentence about glides and the flow breaks; moving it would reorder content, so the writer should decide."
      ]
